OL,3,GNEWSABoat owners urged to prepare for
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoat owners have been told to ensure
OL,7,Ftheir vessels are ready for the winter
OL,8,Fwith stormy conditions forecast.
OL,10,FGuernsey Ports issued the advice after
OL,11,Fthe UK Met Office named Storm Austen
OL,12,Fwith strong winds and heavy rain
OL,13,Fforecast on Thursday evening into
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FAccording to Jersey Met's forecast for
OL,17,FGuernsey, gale force nine wind gusts of
OL,18,Fup to 75mph (121km/h) are expected on
OL,19,FThursday night and Friday morning,
OL,20,Falong with heavy showers and thunder.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
