OL,3,GNEWSABoat owners urged to prepare for
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarbour master James Way said berth
OL,7,Fholders should take precautionary
OL,8,Fmeasures before conditions worsen and
OL,9,Fensure their boats are properly secured
OL,10,Fahead of the winter.
